> 00:01:19,500\nHey, it's going to rain. Do you have an umbrella?\n\n21\n00:01:20,450 --> 00:01:23,225\nNo, I left it at home.\n\n22\n00:01:24,425 --> 00:01:26,980\nHere, take mine.\n\n23\n00:01:27,680 --> 00:01:29,850\nAre you sure?\n\n24\n00:01:30,800 --> 00:01:34,345\nAbsolutely. Give it back to me tonight.\n\n25\n00:01:35,545 --> 00:01:37,935\nOkay. I owe you one.\n\n26\n00:01:38,635 --> 00:01:42,510\nDon't worry. Shall we have dinner together at nine?\n\n27\n00:01:43,460 --> 00:01:45,795\nThat sounds great.\n\n28\n00:01:46,995 --> 00:01:49,660\nPerfect. See you later!\n\n29\n00:01:50,360 --> 00:01:52,860\nHere's your coffee.\n\n30\n00:01:53,810 --> 00:01:57,410\nThank you very much. Have a nice day!\n\n31\n00:02:05,610 --> 00:02:08,440\nExcuse me, could you help me?\n\n32\n00:02:09,140 --> 00:02:11,310\nOf course, go ahead.\n\n33\n00:02:12,260 --> 00:02:15,255\nI'm looking for the train to the city centre.\n\n34\n00:02:16,455 --> 00:02:19,065\nIt leaves from platform four.\n\n35\n00:02:19,765 --> 00:02:22,705\nWhat time does the next one leave?\n\n36\n00:02:23,655 --> 00:02:27,530\nAt quarter past ten, but it's running late today.\n\n37\n00:02:28,730 --> 00:02:31,725\nLate? How long?\n\n38\n00:02:32,425 --> 00:02:35,640\nAbout twenty minutes, more or less.\n\n39\n00:02:36,590 --> 00:02:39,750\nOh no. I have an appointment at eleven.\n\n40\n00:02:40,950 --> 00:02:44,440\nThen you'd better take the bus.\n\n41\n00:02:45,140 --> 00:02:48,190\nIs the stop far from here?\n\n42\n00:02:49,140 --> 00:02:52,355\nNo, it's a five‑minute walk.\n\n43\n00:02:53,555 --> 00:02:57,755\nGo out the main door and turn left.\n\n44\n00:02:58,455 --> 00:03:01,560\nAnd which bus do I need to take?\n\n45\n00:03:02,510 --> 00:03:06,165\nThe thirty‑two. It comes every ten minutes.\n\n46\n00:03:07,365 --> 00:03:11,075\nCould you repeat that, please? More slowly.\n\n47\n00:03:11,775 --> 00:03:15,155\nThe thirty‑two, every ten minutes.\n\n48\n00:03:16,105 --> 00:03:19,595\nPerfect. Thank you